@startuml
!pragma layout smetana
title 优化演进与证据边界 / Optimization Evidence Trail

skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Noto Sans SC
skinparam defaultFontSize 14
skinparam ArrowColor #475569
skinparam ArrowThickness 1.2
skinparam rectangleBorderColor #64748B
skinparam rectangleFontColor #0F172A
skinparam noteBorderColor #94A3B8
skinparam noteBackgroundColor #FEF3C7

top to bottom direction

rectangle "早期串行观测\npreprocess + QNN + copy + pack + GL\n约 11.435 FPS" as Serial #FEE2E2
rectangle "三段有界 overlap\nN+1 inference / N postprocess / N-1 GL\n早期约 17.960 FPS" as Overlap #E0F2FE
rectangle "float NHWC + 四条带 pack\n连续 RGB 访问\n最终 pack p50 / p95 = 11.321 / 15.503 ms" as Nhwc #FCE7F3
rectangle "双 pinned output + deferred copy\ninference caller p95 平均 34.733 -> 30.529 ms\n额外约 23.730 MiB" as Deferred #FEF3C7
rectangle "只在首个成功输出做完整 finite scan\n移除稳态周期性 330-353 ms 停顿" as Finite #ECFDF5
rectangle "同尺寸 output texture 直传\n一次观测 GL submit p95 6.435 -> 3.460 ms\n删除中间纹理与 blit" as Direct #E0F2FE
rectangle "最终默认处理路径\n828 帧，30.0045 FPS\nPTS coverage 约 1，drop / bypass = 0 / 0" as Throughput #DCFCE7
rectangle "仍开放的最终显示门\nQuickSR QNN 1 / 2 PASS\n失败轮最大间隔 58.153 ms" as Display #FEE2E2

Serial --> Overlap : 改变调度结构
Overlap --> Nhwc : 改善输出访存
Nhwc --> Deferred : 移出 inference 关键路径
Deferred --> Finite : 删除稳态诊断停顿
Finite --> Direct : 删除冗余 GL 环节
Direct --> Throughput : 平均处理吞吐达标
Throughput --> Display : 继续验证最终消费者

rectangle "JNI / NEON packer\npack p50 36.566 -> 102.353 ms\n平均 FPS -42.94%\nSTOPPED" as Native #FEE2E2
rectangle "双 PBO upload\nGL p95 3.460 -> 1.832 ms\n显示仍 1 / 2 PASS，+15.820 MiB\nNONDEFAULT" as Pbo #FEF3C7

Nhwc ..> Native : 负结果
Direct ..> Pbo : 局部更快，产品门未改善

note right of Throughput
  图中的数字来自不同阶段和受控 A/B，
  不能相加、相乘或解释成同一帧的耗时分解。
end note

note right of Display
  30 FPS throughput 不等于零抖动显示；
  下一步需要关联 Perfetto、GL fence、
  BufferQueue 与 FrameTimeline。
end note
@enduml
